[For "black"]
[Kind "sideline"]
[Start "caro-nf3 2...d5"]
[Name "2.Nf3: 3.e5"]

3. e5 { Pushes past, as in the Advance. }
3... Bf5 { The bishop comes out, exactly as in the Advance. 3...Bg4 is as good, but after 4.d4 this move is the Advance itself, and that is one thing less to learn. }
4. d4 { The Advance, by another order: ...e6 comes next and the main line follows. }
4... e6 *
